---
description: How to drive and extend nr2grafana (New Relic -> Grafana dashboard migration)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md at the repository root before doing anything in this repo. It
defines the four-step workflow (import -> convert -> validate -> export), the
`inspect` / `explain` commands for understanding a New Relic dashboard, the
`--json` contract and exit codes, how to fix flagged panels through the
mapping config (never by hand-editing dashboard JSON), and the New Relic
semantics every translation must respect.
